:name: nRF52840 UART on a TCP socket
:description: The nice!nano echo firmware with uart0 exposed as a server socket on $port: host programs talk to it like to a USB-UART.
$elf?=$ex_out/nicenano_hello.elf
$port?=3456

using sysbus
mach create "socketuart"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/../nrf52840_nicenano/nicenano.repl
sysbus LoadELF $elf
emulation CreateServerSocketTerminal $port "uartsock" false
connector Connect sysbus.uart0 uartsock
